{
  "id": "muscle-car",
  "title": {"es": "Muscle car tipo Camaro", "en": "Camaro-style muscle car"},
  "hint": {"es": "Desármalo paso a paso o elige una pieza", "en": "Take it apart step by step, or pick a part"},
  "caption": {
    "es": "Esquema propio, inspirado en el Camaro de quinta y sexta generación: capó largo, cabina baja y retrasada, V8 delante y tracción trasera. Al desarmarlo sale primero lo de fuera (capó, puertas, vidrios, carrocería), luego el interior y el tren motriz, y al final las ruedas con sus frenos: queda el chasis solo.",
    "en": "A schematic of our own, inspired by the fifth- and sixth-generation Camaro: long hood, low set-back cabin, front V8 and rear-wheel drive. Taking it apart removes the outside first (hood, doors, glass, body), then the interior and the drivetrain, and finally the wheels with their brakes, leaving the bare chassis."
  },
  "alt": {
    "es": "Muscle car de dos puertas en vista isométrica que se desarma en nueve pasos: capó y maletera, puertas, vidrios, carrocería, asientos y tablero, motor V8, caja y cardán, diferencial y escape, y ruedas con frenos. Queda el chasis con su suspensión.",
    "en": "A two-door muscle car in isometric view that comes apart in nine steps: hood and trunk lid, doors, glass, body, seats and dashboard, V8 engine, gearbox and driveshaft, differential and exhaust, and wheels with brakes. The chassis and its suspension remain."
  },
